# Stirrings of War (ToAU 38). The mission is live only with the must-zone var clear and the Timer passed. The must-zone
# var set (Timer 0): Naja's trigger and the area 5 play nothing; after a rezone, the Timer in the future (var clear):
# nothing; the Timer 0: Naja plays 3134, the area 5 plays 3136 (progress); finished: completed (the Allied Council
# Summons).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/onTriggerAreaEnter/5 AhtUrhganWhitegate/onEventFinish/3136
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=80,-6,-140 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau StirringsOfWar current
login
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
charvar Mission[4][37]mustZone 1
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # must zone alone: nothing
walk 80,-6,-130                         # nothing
walk 80,-6,-140
rezone
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
charvar Mission[4][37]Timer 999999999
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # the Timer alone: nothing
walk 80,-6,-130                         # nothing
walk 80,-6,-140
charvar Mission[4][37]Timer 0
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 3134
finish-if-event
walk 80,-6,-130                         # 3136
finish                                  # completed
